r the Cheval Blanc and Belmond brands; and other activities under the Connaissance des Arts, Cova, Investir, Jardin d'Acclimatation, Le Parisien, Paris Match, and Radio Classique brands. LVMH Moët Hennessy - Louis Vuitton, Société Européenne was founded in 1365 and is headquartered in Paris, France.","fullTimeEmployees":196647,"city":"Paris","country":"France","website":"https://www.lvmh.com","industry":"Luxury Goods","sector":"Consumer Cyclical"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-31"}